WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:18.782
The cat sat on the basket.

2
00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:23.167
"When will she leave?" whispered Benjamin.

3
00:00:23.168 --> 00:00:27.866
"Father will be looking for me."

4
00:00:27.867 --> 00:00:33.089
"These onions smell awful!" whispered Peter.

5
00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:36.414
Tears filled his eyes.

6
00:00:36.415 --> 00:00:39.398
The cat did not leave.

7
00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:44.708
She sat on the basket for five hours!

8
00:00:44.709 --> 00:00:47.890
At last they heard something.

9
00:00:47.891 --> 00:00:51.102
"Benjamin?" someone called.

10
00:00:51.103 --> 00:00:55.625
"That's Father!" whispered Benjamin.

11
00:00:55.626 --> 00:00:59.359
The cat looked up at the wall.

12
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:06.495
Suddenly a large rabbit jumped down.

13
00:01:06.496 --> 00:01:09.733
Wham! He kicked the cat.

14
00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:14.190
Slam! He pushed her inside the greenhouse.

15
00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:21.951
Then—bang! He locked the door.

16
00:01:21.952 --> 00:01:27.317
Benjamin's father lifted the basket.

17
00:01:27.318 --> 00:01:38.249
"You are in big trouble, Benjamin," he said.

18
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:42.807
Later that day the farmer returned from town.

19
00:01:42.808 --> 00:01:46.403
"What happened?" he cried.

20
00:01:46.404 --> 00:01:50.532
Small footprints were everywhere.

21
00:01:50.533 --> 00:01:57.412
The scarecrow's clothes were gone.

22
00:01:57.413 --> 00:02:24.175
And the cat was locked in the greenhouse!

23
00:02:24.176 --> 00:02:32.246
Mrs. Rabbit was upset with Peter.

24
00:02:32.247 --> 00:02:35.650
But she was glad to see him.

25
00:02:35.651 --> 00:02:41.571
"You're safe, Peter," she said.

26
00:02:41.572 --> 00:02:52.339
"And you got your clothes back!"
